{"type":"message","id":"bb9f9292","parentId":"c3e5869b","timestamp":"2026-06-18T02:27:32.865Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether the precision for each coin is dynamically fetched from Binance API or hardcoded. From what I've already read, the precision maps in `binance_auto_trade.py` are hardcoded. Let me check if there's any dynamic fetching from Binance API's exchangeInfo endpoint anywhere in the code.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"从刚才读的代码看，精度是**硬编码写死**的，不是动态获取：\n\n`binance_auto_trade.py` 里两处 map 都是手动维护的字典：\n- `get_quantity_precision()` — 数量精度 map，每个币种一个数字\n- `get_price_precision()` — 价格精度 map，同上\n\n虽然注释里写了「来源：/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo LOT_SIZE.stepSize」，但函数没有实际调 API，只是 fallback 返回默认值 8。\n\nBinomial 交易所的 `GET /fapi/v1/exchangeInfo` 返回 `symbols[].filters[]` 里 `LOT_SIZE.stepSize` 和 `PRICE_FILTER.tickSize` 都可以拿到，完全可以动态解析。要我一起把精度也改成动态获取？这样抽 config 的时候精度不用管，直接从 API 取，加新币种零维护。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":649,"output":340,"cacheRead":23552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24541,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781749647317}}
