{"type":"message","id":"c0a72a2d","parentId":"140243b1","timestamp":"2026-06-18T02:33:31.664Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No config directory exists. OK, let me summarize what needs to change:\n\n1. Create `config/coins.yaml` — symbol + emoji + per_symbol overrides (SOL penalty + cooldown)\n2. Dynamic precision from Binance exchangeInfo API — replace hardcoded precision maps\n3. Update 6 scripts to read from config:\n   - `crypto_signal_monitor.py` — symbol list + per-symbol score bonus + per-symbol cooldown\n   - `binance_auto_trade.py` — remove precision maps, add dynamic fetch\n   - `query_price.py` — emoji mapping\n   - `query_positions.py` — emoji mapping\n   - `verify_trades.py` — symbol list\n   \n4. BTC as benchmark — currently hardcoded `indicators.get(\"BTC\", {})` in 3 places. Should make this a config key `benchmark_coin: BTC`.\n\nActually, the BTC benchmark is an important point. The code uses BTC as the market reference for trend direction in signal scoring. If in the future someone modifies the coin list and doesn't have BTC, this will silently fail (empty dict). Should be configurable.\n\nAlso, the SOL-specific overrides (score bonus +10, cooldown 600s) are currently deep inside the CONFIG dict. These would move to the coins.yaml alongside each coin's emoji.\n\nLet me give the user a clear summary of everything.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"想清楚了，除了 coin config + 动态精度，还有几处要一并处理：\n\n**需要改的东西：**\n\n| 改动 | 说明 |\n|---|---|\n| `config/coins.yaml` 新建 | symbol + emoji + 单币覆盖参数 |\n| 动态精度 | exchangeInfo API 拿 stepSize / tickSize，替代两个硬编码 map |\n| SOL 单币惩罚 | 现在 `per_symbol_bonus: {\"SOL\": 10}` 和冷却 `\"SOL\": 600` 硬编码在 CONFIG 字典里，挪到 coins.yaml 每条币种自己的配置 |\n| BTC 大盘基准 | 代码 3 处 `indicators.get(\"BTC\", {})` 写死了 BTC 当风向标，改成可配置的 `benchmark_coin`，万一以后换 ETH 当基准不用改代码 |\n| emoji 映射 | query_price / query_positions 挪到 coins.yaml |\n\n**不用改的：**\n- `manual_trade.py` — 只是 docstring 示例\n- `health_check.py` / `audit_strategy.py` — 不引具体币种\n- 信号评分里的 `btc_ind` 参数传递 — 已经是变量，只改赋值来源即可\n\n改动范围：新建 1 个 config 文件，修改 5 个脚本，总量不大但覆盖面完整。动手吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":99,"output":902,"cacheRead":29056,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30057,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781750001274}}
{"type":"message","id":"7b2ba718","parentId":"c0a72a2d","timestamp":"2026-06-18T02:34:21.236Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6c01dc6cd844c4366c4a64f9d8d\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6c2333b034a4b2ade61150edd34\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-06-18 10:34 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@_user_1 你能查到币安的所有币的价格吗\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6c01dc6cd844c4366c4a64f9d8d]\n用户124241: [Replying to: \"@_user_1 你能查到币安的所有币的价格吗\"]\n\n先列一个计划表分步执行给我看看"}],"timestamp":1781750061225}}
{"type":"message","id":"77240374","parentId":"7b2ba718","timestamp":"2026-06-18T02:34:32.288Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants a step-by-step plan before I execute. Let me lay out the plan clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 币种配置重构计划\n\n### 第 0 步：新建统一配置文件\n**`config/coins.yaml`**\n```yaml\nbenchmark: BTC          # 大盘基准币种\n\ncoins:\n  BTC: { emoji: \"👑\" }\n  ETH: { emoji: \"💎\" }\n  SOL: { emoji: \"⚡\", score_bonus: 10, cooldown: 600 }\n  BNB: { emoji: \"🔶\" }\n  DOT: { emoji: \"🌐\" }\n  LINK: { emoji: \"🔗\" }\n  XRP: { emoji: \"🪙\" }\n```\n→ 只建文件，不依赖其他模块，零风险。\n\n---\n\n### 第 1 步：动态精度模块\n**`scripts/exchange_info.py`**（新建）\n- 启动时调 `GET /fapi/v1/exchangeInfo`\n- 解析 `LOT_SIZE.stepSize` → 数量精度\n- 解析 `PRICE_FILTER.tickSize` → 价格精度\n- 缓存到内存 dict，提供 `get_quantity_precision(symbol)` / `get_price_precision(symbol)`\n- 提供 `reload()` 热更新接口\n→ 独立模块，不影响现有逻辑，可单独测试。\n\n---\n\n### 第 2 步：改 `binance_auto_trade.py`\n- 删除两个硬编码 precision_map\n- `get_quantity_precision()` / `get_price_precision()` 改为从 exchange_info 模块读缓存\n- 首次调用时自动触发 exchangeInfo 拉取\n→ 旧函数签名不变，兼容所有调用方。\n\n---\n\n### 第 3 步：改 `crypto_signal_monitor.py`\n- 从 `config/coins.yaml` 读 symbols 列表 + benchmark\n- 从 coins.yaml 读 SOL 的 score_bonus / cooldown，替代硬编码\n- 3 处 `indicators.get(\"BTC\", {})` 改为 `indicators.get(benchmark, {})`\n→ 币种和参数全由 config 控制。\n\n---\n\n### 第 4 步：改查询工具（批量）\n- `query_price.py` — emoji 从 coins.yaml 读，symbols 从 yaml 的 keys 拿\n- `query_positions.py` — 同上\n- `verify_trades.py` — SYMBOLS 列表从 coins.yaml 读\n→ 三合一，改完查价/持仓/验证全部自动跟 config 走。\n\n---\n\n### 第 5 步：验证\n- 重启 monitor（`kj`）\n- 跑一遍 `query_price.py`、`query_positions.py`、`verify_trades.py`\n- 确认各币种数据正常、精度正确\n\n---\n\n总共新建 2 个文件，改 5 个脚本。每一步独立可回滚。能动手了吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":443,"output":681,"cacheRead":29696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30820,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781750061234}}
