{"type":"message","id":"54c88b1e","parentId":"3697c14e","timestamp":"2026-06-18T02:41:40.804Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, `manual_trade.py` only has BTC in docstrings/examples. No hardcoded logic. Doesn't need changes.\n\nNow let me compile the full report:\n\n**CODE files that MUST be changed:**\n1. `scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py` — CONFIG[\"symbols\"], per_symbol_bonus, per_symbol cooldown, 3x BTC benchmark\n2. `scripts/binance_auto_trade.py` — quantity precision map, price precision map\n3. `scripts/query_price.py` — emoji map\n4. `scripts/query_positions.py` — emoji map\n5. `scripts/verify_trades.py` — SYMBOLS list\n\n**NEW files to create:**\n6. `config/coins.yaml` — coin config\n7. `scripts/exchange_info.py` — dynamic precision module\n\n**RUNTIME DATA files (no changes needed, auto-generated):**\n- `scripts/crypto_state.json` — runtime, coin keys come from monitor\n- `scripts/crypto_positions.json` — runtime, coin keys come from monitor\n- `scripts/auto_trade_config.json` — risk params only, no coin list\n\n**DOCUMENTATION files (optional, reference updates):**\n- `AGENTS.md`, `SOUL.md`, `策略v6.1.md`, `docs/changelog.md` — mention current 7 coins in prose\n- `manual_trade.py` — docstring examples with BTC (no logic)\n\nLet me present this clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"扫描结果出来了：\n\n### 🔴 必须改的代码文件（5 个）\n\n| 文件 | 硬编码内容 |\n|---|---|\n| `scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py` | CONFIG[\"symbols\"]、per_symbol_bonus(SOL)、cooldown(SOL)、3 处 `indicators.get(\"BTC\")` |\n| `scripts/binance_auto_trade.py` | 数量精度 map + 价格精度 map 共 14 行 |\n| `scripts/query_price.py` | emoji 映射（7 行） |\n| `scripts/query_positions.py` | emoji 映射（7 行） |\n| `scripts/verify_trades.py` | SYMBOLS 列表（1 行） |\n\n### 🟢 新建文件（2 个）\n\n| 文件 | 用途 |\n|---|---|\n| `config/coins.yaml` | 统一币种配置 |\n| `scripts/exchange_info.py` | 动态精度模块 |\n\n### ⚪ 不用动的\n\n| 文件 | 原因 |\n|---|---|\n| `crypto_state.json` / `crypto_positions.json`