{"type":"message","id":"fb00ce8b","parentId":"d43833b3","timestamp":"2026-06-18T02:47:02.511Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, now I have a full picture. Let me summarize:\n\n1. `scripts/crypto_positions.json` - Current positions data\n2. `scripts/crypto_state.json` - Current state (prices, fear/greed, daily pnl, tick count)\n3. `scripts/crypto_alert.txt` - Alert log (3MB, accumulated over a long period)\n4. `logs/trading/monitor.log` - Main trading log\n5. `logs/trading/archive/` - Archived trading logs\n6. `logs/alerts/hourly_YYYY-MM-DD.log` - Hourly alert logs\n7. `logs/watchdog/watchdog.log` - Watchdog log\n8. `logs/news/news.log` - News log","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"核心几个：\n\n| 文件 | 内容 |\n|---|---|\n| `scripts/crypto_positions.json` | 当前持仓详情（入场价、止盈止损等） |\n| `scripts/crypto_state.json` | 运行时状态（价格、恐惧指数、每日盈亏、tick 计数） |\n| `scripts/crypto_alert.txt` | 告警日志（3MB，累积了近一个月） |\n| `logs/trading/monitor.log` | 🎯 **主交易日志** — 所有开仓/平仓/信号记录 |\n| `logs/trading/archive/` | 历史交易日志归档（按时间切片） |\n| `logs/alerts/hourly_YYYY-MM-DD.log` | 每小时整点报告 |\n| `logs/news/news.log` | 新闻抓取日志 |\n| `logs/watchdog/watchdog.log` | 看门狗日志 |\n\n最重要的就是 `logs/trading/monitor.log` 和 `crypto_positions.json` 两个。要我帮你看哪一段？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":616,"output":531,"cacheRead":42880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44027,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781750816728}}
