{"type":"message","id":"7a2774f4","parentId":"658bcabd","timestamp":"2026-06-18T02:51:27.855Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. Let me summarize the coupling issues:\n\n1. **God file problem**: `crypto_signal_monitor.py` at 3015 lines contains: WebSocket handler, signal scoring, position management, order execution, news analysis, AI prediction, Feishu messaging, hourly reporting, state persistence - everything in one file.\n\n2. **Duplicate proxy config**: `127.0.0.1:7890` hardcoded in at least 3 files (crypto_signal_monitor.py, binance_auto_trade.py, crypto_news_fetcher.py)\n\n3. **API keys duplicated**: binance API keys in both `auto_trade_config.json` and hardcoded in `binance_auto_trade.py` and `crypto_signal_monitor.py`\n\n4. **Feishu token/auth**: 4 files have their own Feishu token logic (crypto_signal_monitor.py, feishu_helper.py, health_check.py, reminder_scheduler.py) - though feishu_helper.py was supposed to be the centralized one\n\n5. **Coin config duplication** - the original issue we're solving\n\n6. **No shared constants/config module** - each script reads its own config, duplicates values\n\nLet me present this clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"看了代码全貌，耦合确实不少：\n\n### 🔴 严重的\n\n| 问题 | 具体情况 |\n|---|---|\n| **上帝文件** | `crypto_signal_monitor.py` 3015 行，包揽了 WebSocket、信号、下单、飞书推送、新闻、AI、状态持久化，什么都在里面 |\n| **代理地址重复** | `127.0.0.1:7890` 在 3 个文件里硬编码（monitor、auto_trade、news_fetcher） |\n| **币安密钥分散** | API key/secret 在 `auto_trade_config.json` 和 `binance_auto_trade.py` 两处各一份 |\n| **飞书 token 重复** | 4 个文件各自搞飞书 token 逻辑（monitor、feishu_helper、health_check、reminder_scheduler），但 feishu_helper 本来想做统一入口的却没完全收编干净 |\n\n### 🟡 中等的\n\n| 问题 | 具体情况 |\n|---|---|\n| **币种硬编码** | 刚才说的，5 个文件、精度 2 个 map |\n| **feishu_chat_id 硬编码** | `crypto_signal_monitor.py:151` 写死群 ID，feishu_helper 靠 grep 源码去读这个值 |\n| **无统一 config 模块** | 没有 `config.py`，每个脚本自己拼路径、读文件 |\n\n### 🟢 还行的地方\n\n- import 